# Application instructions

This project is written in Slug. Before writing Slug, read
`slug-lang/README.md`, `slug-lang/getting-started.md`, and
`slug-lang/language.md`. Consult `slug-lang/library.md` for library discovery,
`slug-lang/api-reference.md` for core signatures, and `slug-lang/api-desktop.md`
for optional desktop APIs. Verify unfamiliar APIs against the installed module
sources.
Use `slug-lang/troubleshooting.md` to diagnose setup, source, runtime, and test
failures before changing the environment.

